    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1800" root="بجل" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجِيلٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجَالٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Gross, big, thick,
coarse,</i> or <i>rough;</i> applied to anything. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْرٌ بَجِيلٌ</span> <i>An affair, an event,</i> or <i>a case, deemed
strange,</i> or <i>evil, and great,</i> or <i>formidable.</i> (TA.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَيْرٌ بَجِيلٌ</span> <i>Ample, abundant, good</i> or <i>wealth</i> or
<i>prosperity.</i> (TA.)

